docs {
  ### Get Presigned R2 Upload URL - Validation Failure
  Verifies that sending an invalid or empty request body fails validation checks.
  
  #### Response (400 Bad Request)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Bad Request",
    "details": [
      "fileName should not be empty",
      "contentType should not be empty"
    ],
    "status": 400
  }
  ```
}
